<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center; background-color: white">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On October 24, 2025, Jiuzi Holdings Inc. (the
&ldquo;Registrant&rdquo; or the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;) held the Phase I Extraordinary General Meeting (the &ldquo;Phase I Meeting&rdquo;),
followed by the Phase II Extraordinary General Meeting of the Company (the &ldquo;Phase II Meeting.&rdquo;)</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">At the Phase I Meeting, the Company&rsquo;s shareholders
approved the proposal that every five issued and unissued ordinary shares of a par value of US$0.00039 each, be consolidated into one
share of a par value of US$0.00195 each (the &ldquo;Phase I Share Consolidation&rdquo;). Following the Phase I Share Consolidation, the
authorized share capital of the Company will be US$9,750,000 divided into 5,000,000,000 shares each of a par value of US$0.00195 each.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">At the Phase II Meeting, the Company&rsquo;s shareholders
approved (1) the proposal that every forty issued and unissued ordinary shares of a par value of US$0.00195 each, be consolidated into
one share of a par value of US$0.078 each (the &ldquo;Phase II Share Consolidation&rdquo;). Following the Phase II Share Consolidation,
the authorized share capital of the Company will be US$9,750,000 divided into 125,000,000 shares each of a par value of US$0.078 each
and (2) the proposal that the sixth amended and restated memorandum and articles of association of the Company (the &ldquo;Sixth Amended
and Restated M&amp;A&rdquo;) be approved as the memorandum and articles of association of the Company in complete substitution for the
existing memorandum and articles of association of the Company.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company&rsquo;s Sixth Amended and Restated
Memorandum and Articles of Association are attached as Exhibit 3.1 to this Form 6-K.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>Exhibits</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

